\author/literal{Jonathan Prieto-Cubides}
\author{fredrikbakke}
\author/literal{others}
\meta{external}{https://unimath.github.io/agda-unimath/}

\p{
The agda-unimath library is a community formalization project for univalent
mathematics in Agda. The library project was created by Elisabeth Stenholm, Jonathan
Prieto-Cubides, and Egbert Rijke, and is currently being maintained by Egbert Rijke,
Fredrik Bakke, and Elif Uskuplu. Our goal is to formalize an extensive curriculum of
mathematics from the univalent point of view. Furthermore, we think libraries of
formalized mathematics have the potential to be useful, and informative resources for
mathematicians. Our library is designed to work towards this goal, and we welcome
contributions to the library about any topic in mathematics.
}

